#: luci-app-vantage-traffic/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-vantage-traffic.json:3
msgid "Vantage dashboard: per-device traffic through this router, from its connection tracking (luci.vantage.traffic hosts: bytes from and to each MAC address, no remote addresses). Experimental. Not part of the dashboard's own group: grant it with luci-app-vantage to a login that may see per-device traffic too"
msgstr "Vantage 仪表盘：按设备统计经过此路由器的流量，来自其连接跟踪（luci.vantage.traffic hosts：每个 MAC 地址的收发字节数，不含远端地址）。实验性功能。它不属于仪表盘自身的权限组：如需让某个登录账户同时看到按设备统计的流量，请将其与 luci-app-vantage 一并授予"
